WEBVTT

00:00:11.340 --> 00:00:12.420
Cocona?

00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:13.780
Cocona!

00:00:18.420 --> 00:00:19.620
Cocona!

00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:36.460
Sorry, I have no idea what you're saying.

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:39.380
But...

00:00:44.130 --> 00:00:45.680
I'll definitely find her!

00:00:54.960 --> 00:00:57.280
Is that you, Mimi-sama?

00:00:58.800 --> 00:01:00.370
You were at the lab...

00:01:05.710 --> 00:01:09.140
At last, the amorphous has returned to us!

00:01:17.170 --> 00:01:18.470
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:01:19.880 --> 00:01:21.470
Seize the amorphous!

00:01:25.130 --> 00:01:27.190
You want to take Cocona away again?

00:01:45.730 --> 00:01:49.170
Only I, her mother, may touch her.

00:01:49.380 --> 00:01:52.170
S-Splendid!

00:01:56.400 --> 00:01:57.820
If you get in my way,

00:01:58.670 --> 00:01:59.970
I'll kill you.

00:03:34.870 --> 00:03:35.650
Seize her!

00:03:44.140 --> 00:03:46.410
Where is the third child?!

00:03:53.920 --> 00:03:55.380
I'm here!

00:03:55.380 --> 00:03:57.320
I wanna go nuts, too!

00:03:57.320 --> 00:03:59.190
Any enemies anywhere?

00:04:10.040 --> 00:04:11.390
Just a giant toy...

00:04:11.390 --> 00:04:15.020
Mimi-sama, I shall accompany you.

00:04:15.020 --> 00:04:17.050
With your power,

00:04:17.050 --> 00:04:22.440
the border between Pure Illusion 
and reality may as well not exist.

00:04:22.440 --> 00:04:25.320
The world I longed for...

00:04:26.340 --> 00:04:30.560
Pure Illusion only exists for Cocona's sake.

00:04:33.670 --> 00:04:35.560
Splendid...

00:04:36.020 --> 00:04:38.340
Absolutely splendid!

00:04:42.400 --> 00:04:43.300
Blood.

00:04:43.680 --> 00:04:45.250
Wound just opened.

00:04:45.580 --> 00:04:46.720
No problem.

00:04:47.780 --> 00:04:49.850
Requesting recall of order.

00:04:53.730 --> 00:04:54.850
Not getting through.

00:04:57.800 --> 00:05:01.300
Uh, will Salt-san be okay?

00:05:01.300 --> 00:05:03.430
No need to worry!

00:05:03.430 --> 00:05:05.530
Actually, there's no point in worrying!

00:05:07.970 --> 00:05:09.840
The situation has changed.

00:05:09.840 --> 00:05:11.630
I leave the rest to you.

00:05:13.140 --> 00:05:14.240
Where are you going?

00:05:20.300 --> 00:05:21.800
Of course.

00:05:30.120 --> 00:05:31.160
Let's go.

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:42.090
What the hell?!

00:05:42.090 --> 00:05:44.000
Who did this?!

00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:45.500
I did.

00:05:50.590 --> 00:05:52.860
I-I'll take her!

00:05:51.760 --> 00:05:52.860
G-Guard robot!

00:05:52.860 --> 00:05:56.080
I-I'll have you know I've 
trained in martial arts!

00:05:53.490 --> 00:05:56.080
We need a guard robot!

00:06:08.500 --> 00:06:10.640
Hey, third kid.

00:06:10.910 --> 00:06:13.350
No! I'm Nyunyu!

00:06:13.710 --> 00:06:15.350
Nyu—Nyunyu?

00:06:15.780 --> 00:06:17.370
Not Nyunyunyu!

00:06:17.370 --> 00:06:18.350
Nyunyu.

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:21.360
You're a funny one.

00:06:34.950 --> 00:06:37.120
It's been too long, Salt.

00:06:38.360 --> 00:06:40.610
Wow. Aren't you surprised?

00:06:41.550 --> 00:06:44.630
You came back to life in the 
form of your daughter...

00:06:45.240 --> 00:06:46.120
Mimi?

00:06:47.220 --> 00:06:48.050
Yes.

00:06:48.910 --> 00:06:52.260
Nobody wanted to see you like this.

00:06:53.080 --> 00:06:54.510
It's for Cocona's sake.

00:06:54.980 --> 00:06:57.040
I have to protect her...

00:06:59.740 --> 00:07:02.680
because you didn't.

00:07:04.950 --> 00:07:07.400
Yeah, I didn't. I couldn't.

00:07:09.400 --> 00:07:13.030
And I'll have to make up for that.

00:07:17.670 --> 00:07:19.660
What's the matter, Mimi?

00:07:20.920 --> 00:07:22.300
It fits you now.

00:07:23.640 --> 00:07:25.900
It was always too baggy for you before.

00:07:28.170 --> 00:07:29.330
Oh, yeah.

00:07:30.140 --> 00:07:33.340
Until now, I was a trainee under Dad,

00:07:33.970 --> 00:07:37.840
but they officially made 
me a researcher, at last.

00:07:37.840 --> 00:07:39.600
Congrats, Salt!

00:07:40.670 --> 00:07:44.100
So you're going to research me.

00:07:44.870 --> 00:07:48.570
I wish we could learn more

00:07:48.570 --> 00:07:51.070
about Pure Illusion without hurting anyone.

00:07:51.940 --> 00:07:53.650
I'll be fine.

00:07:53.650 --> 00:07:54.550
But...

00:07:54.920 --> 00:07:57.970
Besides, thanks to you and Papika,

00:07:58.310 --> 00:08:00.750
I can even do this!

00:08:28.520 --> 00:08:30.360
What's this container, Dad?

00:08:30.630 --> 00:08:32.840
New equipment for our experiments.

00:08:32.840 --> 00:08:34.360
We call it ELPIS.

00:08:35.020 --> 00:08:36.180
ELPIS?

00:08:37.520 --> 00:08:41.140
Before, we couldn't set a 
destination in Pure Illusion,

00:08:41.140 --> 00:08:43.370
and we had no idea where they would end up.

00:08:43.620 --> 00:08:45.130
That changes today.

00:08:45.130 --> 00:08:46.830
We can choose a destination?

00:08:46.830 --> 00:08:47.610
Yes.

00:08:48.040 --> 00:08:52.280
We can open the Pure Illusion 
of the person inside ELPIS.

00:08:54.930 --> 00:08:55.510
Wait!

00:08:59.970 --> 00:09:02.050
Is he still not coming to?

00:09:02.050 --> 00:09:02.820
What's the cause?

00:09:02.820 --> 00:09:04.020
<i>We can't tell!</i>

00:09:04.020 --> 00:09:05.670
<i>Why did it end up like this?</i>

00:09:04.310 --> 00:09:06.190
Dad! Dad!

00:09:10.460 --> 00:09:11.720
Salt...

00:09:12.320 --> 00:09:14.900
That is an absolutely splendid power.

00:09:14.900 --> 00:09:18.000
Pure Illusion's border 
will come crashing down...

00:09:18.000 --> 00:09:19.910
No, we must make it do so!

00:09:20.140 --> 00:09:21.830
What's wrong, Dad?

00:09:20.880 --> 00:09:23.470
We must bring Pure Illusion to reality!

00:09:27.580 --> 00:09:30.060
I'm sorry. I shouldn't have...

00:09:30.540 --> 00:09:33.150
No, it's not your fault.

00:09:33.150 --> 00:09:34.300
Right, Sal—

00:09:39.800 --> 00:09:41.810
No need to knock!
- Papika

00:09:42.820 --> 00:09:43.840
Papika,

00:09:44.610 --> 00:09:46.040
we need to talk.

00:09:49.550 --> 00:09:50.560
Come in.

00:09:52.440 --> 00:09:53.570
You want to leave?

00:09:54.810 --> 00:09:55.570
Yeah.

00:09:57.670 --> 00:10:00.070
Why would you...

00:10:00.370 --> 00:10:02.000
Mimi and I talked it out.

00:10:02.380 --> 00:10:05.330
We'll leave this lab and see more of the—

00:10:04.220 --> 00:10:06.890
You're going to run away after what you did?

00:10:07.760 --> 00:10:08.500
That's...

00:10:10.820 --> 00:10:13.660
After you destroyed Dad's mind?

00:10:14.250 --> 00:10:16.020
Salt! How could you say that?!

00:10:16.630 --> 00:10:17.560
It's fine.

00:10:17.910 --> 00:10:21.580
I am the one making him suffer.

00:10:22.490 --> 00:10:25.740
But I still need you, Salt!

00:10:26.100 --> 00:10:28.460
Please run away with us!

00:10:30.740 --> 00:10:33.400
You know I can't do that.

00:10:33.400 --> 00:10:35.380
Salt, Mimi's...

00:10:35.760 --> 00:10:36.780
Mimi's...

00:10:37.840 --> 00:10:38.960
I'm sorry.

00:10:39.890 --> 00:10:43.440
Thank you for being with me all these years.

00:10:45.840 --> 00:10:48.080
Goodbye, Salt.

00:10:58.020 --> 00:11:00.240
It seems they captured number 33.

00:11:00.240 --> 00:11:03.760
We can finally resume our experiments. 
It's been one long year.

00:11:06.540 --> 00:11:08.520
Stop! Let me go!

00:11:08.520 --> 00:11:10.520
I said lemme go!

00:11:10.520 --> 00:11:12.020
That's enough!

00:11:15.980 --> 00:11:17.500
What is this?

00:11:22.510 --> 00:11:23.820
It won't come off.

00:11:28.150 --> 00:11:30.750
Oh, Mimi-sama!

00:11:31.270 --> 00:11:34.240
Please give Cocona back!

00:11:34.240 --> 00:11:36.880
Don't hurt her!

00:11:37.740 --> 00:11:38.840
Cocona?

00:11:46.050 --> 00:11:48.170
Salt, Mimi's...

00:11:48.530 --> 00:11:49.350
Mimi's...

00:11:51.660 --> 00:11:55.070
Why didn't you say anything?

00:12:08.560 --> 00:12:09.540
Mimi!

00:12:11.290 --> 00:12:12.750
I'm glad you're okay.

00:12:13.190 --> 00:12:14.470
And Cocona, too.

00:12:15.400 --> 00:12:16.660
How?

00:12:23.270 --> 00:12:25.390
Let's run away. All four of us.

00:12:33.390 --> 00:12:34.340
Papika!

00:12:37.900 --> 00:12:39.320
Ow...

00:12:39.770 --> 00:12:40.610
Get away!

00:12:40.920 --> 00:12:43.470
I don't want us to be separated again!

00:12:52.120 --> 00:12:53.990
No... No!

00:12:53.990 --> 00:12:54.720
Don't!

00:12:54.720 --> 00:12:56.580
Cocona... Cocona!

00:12:57.550 --> 00:13:01.340
You have to stay here forever.

00:13:02.790 --> 00:13:06.350
So, to make sure you never try 
something like this again,

00:13:06.770 --> 00:13:08.970
you need to be punished.

00:13:09.510 --> 00:13:10.600
Dad!

00:13:10.990 --> 00:13:11.900
No!

00:13:11.900 --> 00:13:13.220
Please, no!

00:13:13.220 --> 00:13:14.960
Give Cocona back!

00:13:15.440 --> 00:13:16.600
Cocona...

00:13:16.900 --> 00:13:19.060
Cocona!

00:13:58.450 --> 00:14:01.700
Is... this my...

00:14:03.170 --> 00:14:04.970
Do you want to protect Cocona?

00:14:06.800 --> 00:14:09.490
Cocona needs you, too.

00:14:09.990 --> 00:14:12.660
Every daughter needs her mother.

00:14:15.030 --> 00:14:16.600
I do want to protect her.

00:14:17.050 --> 00:14:17.660
But...

00:14:18.580 --> 00:14:20.540
I'll protect her for you.

00:14:21.350 --> 00:14:22.390
So...

00:14:23.400 --> 00:14:25.040
switch with me.

00:14:26.820 --> 00:14:27.860
Cocona...

00:14:45.740 --> 00:14:46.740
Mimi!

00:14:45.740 --> 00:14:46.740
Mimi!

00:14:47.700 --> 00:14:49.740
I don't need anything.

00:14:50.720 --> 00:14:51.870
Not this place,

00:14:52.560 --> 00:14:53.870
or you people.

00:14:54.680 --> 00:14:57.870
All I need is Cocona.

00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:00.540
Stop, Mimi!

00:15:02.160 --> 00:15:04.200
Cocona, Cocona.

00:15:04.540 --> 00:15:06.670
My dear Cocona...

00:15:09.270 --> 00:15:10.340
I'm sorry.

00:15:12.620 --> 00:15:15.280
Mimi!

00:15:26.760 --> 00:15:29.280
You made the wrong choice.

00:15:29.880 --> 00:15:30.990
Oh?

00:15:30.990 --> 00:15:32.790
Speak for yourself.

00:15:32.790 --> 00:15:34.030
I was right.

00:15:34.560 --> 00:15:39.000
The real Mimi would never want 
to show up looking like this.

00:15:50.450 --> 00:15:52.280
I am Mimi.

00:15:52.280 --> 00:15:54.470
Just like with your father,

00:15:54.470 --> 00:15:57.200
people have several faces,

00:15:57.550 --> 00:15:59.530
and so does Pure Illusion.

00:16:00.100 --> 00:16:02.100
And they're all real.

00:16:03.460 --> 00:16:05.110
We're done talking.

00:16:06.900 --> 00:16:07.930
Cocona!

00:16:09.360 --> 00:16:10.960
Why are you doing this to her?

00:16:11.420 --> 00:16:13.380
Long time no see, Papika.

00:16:18.620 --> 00:16:19.740
Isn't that...

00:16:20.100 --> 00:16:20.910
Mimi?

00:16:21.320 --> 00:16:22.150
Yes.

00:16:22.620 --> 00:16:24.920
I see you haven't changed one bit.

00:16:25.180 --> 00:16:27.000
Get away, Papikana!

00:16:45.730 --> 00:16:46.650
Don't!

00:16:48.880 --> 00:16:51.040
Can you really do it, as kind as you are?

00:16:55.860 --> 00:16:57.490
I don't need you anymore.

00:17:10.390 --> 00:17:12.860
Stop me, Salt.

00:17:12.860 --> 00:17:14.040
Honestly,

00:17:14.040 --> 00:17:18.790
I only wanted to watch over 
Cocona from afar, that was all.

00:17:20.210 --> 00:17:22.080
Goodbye, Salt.

00:17:32.300 --> 00:17:33.950
I've changed.

00:17:33.950 --> 00:17:36.840
I've decided I'll do anything for Cocona.

00:17:37.200 --> 00:17:38.410
Wait, where's Cocona?

00:17:39.320 --> 00:17:40.740
She'll always be with me.

00:17:40.740 --> 00:17:44.160
We'll live happily forever.

00:17:44.420 --> 00:17:45.640
Bring her back!

00:17:50.480 --> 00:17:53.530
Who do you really want 
me to bring back? Cocona?

00:17:53.880 --> 00:17:55.720
Or the Mimi from days past?

00:17:56.160 --> 00:17:57.340
Well...

00:17:58.900 --> 00:18:01.190
Oh, so you can't choose.

00:18:01.890 --> 00:18:04.580
Then let me spell it out for you once more.

00:18:05.590 --> 00:18:06.350
I hate you.

00:18:22.210 --> 00:18:24.430
Welcome back, Cocona.

00:18:26.410 --> 00:18:27.120
Uh...

00:18:28.560 --> 00:18:29.960
I'm your mother.

00:18:30.330 --> 00:18:33.340
I'm sorry I left you alone for so long.

00:18:33.970 --> 00:18:35.820
Mother?

00:18:36.620 --> 00:18:37.440
Yes.

00:18:39.590 --> 00:18:40.760
What's wrong?

00:18:41.990 --> 00:18:45.430
I've always wanted to talk to you!

00:18:45.430 --> 00:18:49.390
I wanted to tell you about 
school and my friends!

00:18:49.390 --> 00:18:51.570
I wanted your advice about my future!

00:18:51.570 --> 00:18:53.480
And... And...

00:18:55.380 --> 00:18:56.880
It's all right now.

00:18:56.880 --> 00:18:58.900
You don't have to worry 
about anything anymore.

00:18:59.740 --> 00:19:00.660
Mom...

00:19:02.020 --> 00:19:04.300
I'll do everything for you.

00:19:11.200 --> 00:19:13.060
Salt!

00:19:24.300 --> 00:19:25.510
I hate you.

00:19:33.800 --> 00:19:35.230
You have pretty hair.

00:19:35.230 --> 00:19:37.260
Why don't you let it grow, like me?

00:19:37.990 --> 00:19:39.400
It wouldn't suit me.

00:19:39.400 --> 00:19:41.100
Of course it would.

00:19:42.090 --> 00:19:42.910
See?

00:19:43.780 --> 00:19:44.720
But...

00:19:47.570 --> 00:19:49.240
I knew it would look great on you.

00:19:49.600 --> 00:19:50.690
Turn me back.

00:19:51.090 --> 00:19:53.540
No. You look so cute this way.

00:19:54.520 --> 00:19:56.590
My friends will make fun of me.

00:19:56.590 --> 00:19:57.640
What?

00:19:57.640 --> 00:20:00.230
They don't deserve you, then.

00:20:00.620 --> 00:20:03.700
I'll make you new friends.

00:20:07.460 --> 00:20:08.360
Come here.

00:20:12.440 --> 00:20:14.110
I don't like this place.

00:20:19.840 --> 00:20:22.310
Don't you worry about anything.

00:20:22.310 --> 00:20:26.300
I'll create any world you wish for.

00:20:27.320 --> 00:20:29.410
All I need is you by my side.

00:20:33.050 --> 00:20:34.210
Do you like this place?

00:20:34.790 --> 00:20:36.730
Let's take it, then.

00:20:37.610 --> 00:20:39.920
Yeah, Mom.

00:20:40.850 --> 00:20:42.920
Aren't there a lot of kids absent today?

00:20:43.090 --> 00:20:46.400
Come to think of it, it's unusual 
for Cocona to be absent.

00:20:46.400 --> 00:20:48.920
Right? Maybe it'll snow next.

00:20:51.610 --> 00:20:52.660
No way.

00:21:06.820 --> 00:21:08.700
What the hell is that?

00:21:12.570 --> 00:21:13.900
Salt-san!

00:21:19.200 --> 00:21:20.750
I need a favor.

00:21:24.380 --> 00:21:26.480
Don't you look down in the dumps?

00:21:27.480 --> 00:21:28.610
Yayaka?

00:21:28.610 --> 00:21:29.540
Why?

00:21:30.100 --> 00:21:32.020
I'm not here because I want to be.

00:21:35.040 --> 00:21:36.140
An amorphous?

00:21:36.550 --> 00:21:38.450
Save Papika.

00:21:38.780 --> 00:21:40.260
Screw you!

00:21:40.260 --> 00:21:41.640
Why would I ever—

00:21:46.980 --> 00:21:47.930
Please!

00:21:51.230 --> 00:21:53.660
Are you gonna mope around forever?

00:21:54.760 --> 00:21:55.660
But...

00:21:59.510 --> 00:22:00.170
Wha—

00:22:00.170 --> 00:22:01.360
Shut up!

00:22:02.130 --> 00:22:04.960
I'm asking you if you want to save Cocona!

00:22:06.150 --> 00:22:07.110
Well...

00:22:07.110 --> 00:22:10.190
Listen up, and listen good. 
I want to save Cocona.

00:22:10.190 --> 00:22:12.970
I don't care if I have to go up 
against her mother or whatever!

00:22:15.010 --> 00:22:16.680
I'll save her because she's my friend!

00:22:17.120 --> 00:22:18.390
What about you?

00:22:19.500 --> 00:22:20.810
I...

00:22:22.000 --> 00:22:22.720
Tch.

00:22:26.850 --> 00:22:28.570
Pure Illusion?

00:22:28.570 --> 00:22:30.640
The first one I went to with Cocona?

00:22:30.950 --> 00:22:31.620
Hop on.

00:22:31.910 --> 00:22:32.910
It's not safe here.

00:22:38.950 --> 00:22:42.110
At last, the time of liberation has come!

00:22:50.660 --> 00:22:53.050
We can't keep running forever.

00:22:54.510 --> 00:22:55.840
What do we do?

00:22:58.800 --> 00:23:00.120
You're right.

00:23:00.520 --> 00:23:02.360
If this keeps up, the world will be in danger—

00:23:02.360 --> 00:23:03.360
To hell with that!

00:23:04.810 --> 00:23:07.510
That out-of-character crap 
isn't what I want to hear!

00:23:07.510 --> 00:23:09.500
That's not who you are!

00:23:10.200 --> 00:23:11.580
I...

00:23:12.980 --> 00:23:15.870
I want to save Cocona because 
I love, love, <i>love</i> her!

00:23:16.010 --> 00:23:16.770
Well said!

00:23:16.770 --> 00:23:17.700
We're winging this!

00:23:18.120 --> 00:23:19.680
No trial runs, okay?

00:23:19.680 --> 00:23:20.370
Okay!

00:23:22.310 --> 00:23:25.750
Go!

00:23:30.090 --> 00:23:31.850
You have promise.

00:23:31.850 --> 00:23:32.650
I'm Nyunyu.

00:23:32.650 --> 00:23:33.480
Nyou're Nyunyu?

00:23:33.480 --> 00:23:35.420
Nyu sells new shells on the nyu-shore!

00:23:35.420 --> 00:23:37.200
Nyu sells new shells on nya nyu—

00:23:36.430 --> 00:23:39.430
Pure Howling

00:23:37.200 --> 00:23:38.960
Nyu this!
